Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.45,0:00:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just looking your job post\Nright here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.15,0:00:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,this is honestly right up my alley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.75,0:00:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I've direct experience\Nworking on these types of projects
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.85,0:00:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and if you actually you head over\Nto my profile right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.15,0:00:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you can see that\NI've never had a bad review
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've done a lot of work\Non upwork
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you can even see real examples
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,of me building automations\Nright here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.40,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have 100% jss
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,which means\NI've consistently delivered
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,great results\Nfor my previous clients .
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to work with you too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.10,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and I just wanted to quickly\Nintroduce myself
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and give you a better idea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,of who's behind the proposal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and yes Thanks for taking\Ntime to watch,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,speak soon
